iaoXinPro 16 IAH\\\\Desktop\\\\LRIA_llm_eval\\\\eval\\\\Quantum_Bvt_20251110\\\\bvtfiles\\\\3u84xhcdicdb6vqtlfud7syhj444z2.txt\",\"previewPath\":\"c:\\\\users\\\\xiaoxinpro 16 iah\\\\documents\\\\qtcore\\\\pdffile\\\\044561594142e2ef357c9fbbdfaf4af5.pdf\",\"priority\":3,\"score\":0.0,\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"tokenNum\":414,\"uriPath\":\"\"},{\"createTime\":\"2025-11-10T15:52:22.668\",\"description\":\"In Chapter XVIII, Archie is ordered to assist the Earl and a sizeable group of men-at-arms in searching for Bruce, whose location was revealed by a traitor. Archie, though reluctant, prepares the hound, Hector, for the hunt and considers drastic measures to protect Bruce if they get too close. The party, led by the traitorous peasant, travels five miles into the hills to a hut where Bruce had recently stayed. Upon arrival, Hector becomes energetic and excited, eagerly sniffing around before picking up Bruce's trail. The hound’s pursuit is intense, forcing Archie to struggle to keep pace while the Earl and his knights follow at a slight distance with their men-at-arms. Archie warns the Earl that the noise from the horses and the knights’ equipment agitates the hound further, making him harder to control. The tense search unfolds with Archie contemplating escape should the situation demand it, given the formidable presence of mounted pursuers.\",\"docName\":\"3z3zlgnnsiuha76yy56h6uu71bh3q1\",\"editTime\":\"2025-11-10T15:53:29.649\",\"fileName\":\"3z3zlgnnsiuha76yy56h6uu71bh3q1.txt\",\"folder\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\XiaoXinPro 16 IAH\\\\Desktop\\\\LRIA_llm_eval\\\\eval\\\\Quantum_Bvt_20251110\\\\bvtfiles\",\"id\":1987790422193344512,\"isDeleted\":0,\"isTmpFile\":false,\"labelNameList\":[\"Informational\",\"History\",\"Report\"],\"lastModifyTime\":\"2025-09-17T09:45:00\",\"md5\":\"bb28043dd606535bdcaf1ee30346b0f9\",\"path\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\XiaoXinPro 16 IAH\\\\Desktop\\\\LRIA_llm_eval\\\\eval\\\\Quantum_Bvt_20251110\\\\bvtfiles\\\\3z3zlgnnsiuha76yy56h6uu71bh3q1.txt\",\"previewPath\":\"c:\\\\users\\\\xiaoxinpro 16 iah\\\\documents\\\\qtcore\\\\pdffile\\\\c5016b94612aaf89641b2e6895248f70.pdf\",\"priority\":4,\"score\":0.0,\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"tokenNum\":326,\"uriPath\":\"\"},{\"createTime\":\"2025-11-10T15:52:22.688\",\"description\":\"This document outlines the design of an AI Face Algorithm Evaluation Method, focusing on test set collection and variable matrices. It specifies head movement variables—pitch (up/down), yaw (left/right), and roll (clockwise/counterclockwise)—each with specified movement angles and data rates, as well as facial movements including mouth, eyes, and eyebrows, and associated conditions. Light exposure is detailed into weak, medium, strong, and uneven categories to account for optical flow variability. Horizontal head movement is included, with both left and right motion measured. Data is gathered using a laptop camera and Ruifeng's collection tool, using input video as both the driving video and ground truth; specific images are used as source images. Evaluation involves comparing driving and output videos. The protocol requires 70 videos (minimum 5 seconds each), with 10 videos per variable and targeting multiple participants, with at least 7 represented overall. The data rate defines each video’s contribution per variable. Emphasis is placed on collecting a diverse and representative dataset for robust algorithm assessment.\",\"docName\":\"AI_Face_Test_Set_Collection_Method_Design\",\"editTime\":\"2025-11-10T15:53:44.023\",\"fileName\":\"AI_Face_Test_Set_Collection_Method_Design.pptx\",\"folder\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\XiaoXinPro 16 IAH\\\\Desktop\\\\LRIA_llm_eval\\\\eval\\\\Quantum_Bvt_20251110\\\\bvtfiles\",\"id\":1987790422277230592,\"isDeleted\":0,\"isTmpFile\":false,\"labelNameList\":[\"Technology\",\"Data Analysis\",\"Specifications\"],\"lastModifyTime\":\"2025-09-17T09:46:00\",\"md5\":\"b0f396e7936e0f6192cd880927e8e74b\",\"path\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\XiaoXinPro 16 IAH\\\\Desktop\\\\LRIA_llm_eval\\\\eval\\\\Quantum_Bvt_20251110\\\\bvtfiles\\\\AI_Face_Test_Set_Collection_Method_Design.pptx\",\"previewPath\":\"c:\\\\users\\\\xiaoxinpro 16 iah\\\\documents\\\\qtcore\\\\pdffile\\\\c85631aabec673dabeda2b80233b5341.pdf\",\"priority\":5,\"score\":0.0,\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"tokenNum\":432,\"uriPath\":\"\"},{\"createTime\":\"2025-11-10T15:52:22.707\",\"description\":\"\",\"docName\":\"\",\"editTime\":\"2025-11-10T15:53:40.386\",\"fileName\":\"A_brief_introduction_of_LP_liutao21_20220615.pptx\",\"folder\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\XiaoXinPro 16 IAH\\\\Desktop\\\\LRIA_llm_eval\\\\eval\\\\Quantum_Bvt_20251110\\\\bvtfiles\",\"id\":1987790422356922368,\"isDeleted\":0,\"isTmpFile\":false,\"labelNameList\":[],\"lastModifyTime\":\"2025-09-17T09:46:00\",\"md5\":\"0dbb2532524843af54fb3388b7bf3381\",\"path\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\XiaoXinPro 16 IAH\\\\Desktop\\\\LRIA_llm_eval\\\\eval\\\\Quantum_Bvt_20251110\\\\bvtfiles\\\\A_brief_introduction_of_LP_liutao21_20220615.pptx\",\"priority\":6,\"score\":0.0,\"status\":\"RUNNING\",\"tokenNum\":0,\"uriPath\":\"\"},{\"createTime\":\"2025-11-10T15:52:22.764\",\"description\":\"\",\"docName\":\"\",\"editTime\":\"2025-11-10T15:52:22.764\",\"errorDescription\":\"\",\"fileName\":\"Belfast-English.docx\",\"folder\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\XiaoXinPro 16 IAH\\\\Desktop\\\\LRIA_llm_eval\\\\eval\\\\Quantum_Bvt_20251110\\\\bvtfiles\",\"id\":1987790422595997696,\"isDeleted\":0,\"isTmpFile\":false,\"labelNameList\":[],\"lastModifyTime\":\"2025-09-17T09:45:00\",\"md5\":\"3193e699ffa92db332ae31a9fb1d3cb4\",\"path\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\XiaoXinPro 16 IAH\\\\Desktop\\\\LRIA_llm_eval\\\\eval\\\\Quantum_Bvt_20251110\\\\bvtfiles\\\\Belfast-English.docx\",\"priority\":7,\"score\":0.0,\"status\":\"ADDED\",\"tokenNum\":0,\"uriPath\":\"\"},{\"createTime\":\"2025-11-10T15:52:22.784\",\"description\":\"\",\"docName\":\"\",\"editTime\":\"2025-11-10T15:52:22.784\",\"errorDescription\":\"\",\"fileName\":\"British-Food-Culture.doc\",\"folder\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\XiaoXinPro 16 IAH\\\\Desktop\\\\LRIA_llm_eval\\\\eval\\\\Quantum_Bvt_20251110\\\\bvtfiles\",\"id\":1987790422679883776,\"isDeleted\":0,\"isTmpFile\":false,\"labelNameList\":[],\"lastModifyTime\":\"2025-09-17T09:45:00\",\"md5\":\"435798f1c3377c7f5b71e18d733ca579\",\"path\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\XiaoXinPro 16 IAH\\\\Desktop\\\\LRIA_llm_eval\\\\eval\\\\Quantum_Bvt_20251110\\\\bvtfiles\\\\British-Food-Culture.doc\",\"priority\":8,\"score\":0.0,\"status\":\"ADDED\",\"tokenNum\":0,\"uriPath\":\"\"},{\"createTime\":\"2025-11-10T15:52:22.803\",\"description\":\"\",\"docName\":\"\",\"editTime\":\"2025-11-10T15:52:22.803\",\"errorDescription\":\"\",\"fileName\":\"Netflix Becomes a Broadway Producer With Peter Morgan’s Patriots.txt\",\"folder\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\XiaoXinPro 16 IAH\\\\Desktop\\\\LRIA_llm_eval\\\\eval\\\\Quantum_Bvt_20251110\\\\bvtfiles\",\"id\":1987790422759575552,\"isDeleted\":0,\"isTmpFile\":false,\"labelNameList\":[],\"lastModifyTime\":\"2025-09-17T09:46:00\",\"md5\":\"ab84c46eaa62a18048fb0241446da4ca\",\"path\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\XiaoXinPro 16 IAH\\\\Desktop\\\\LRIA_llm_eval\\\\eval\\\\Quantum_Bvt_20251110\\\\bvtfiles\\\\Netflix Becomes a Broadway Producer With Peter Morgan’s Patriots.txt\",\"priority\":9,\"score\":0.0,\"status\":\"ADDED\",\"tokenNum\":0,\"uriPath\":\"\"}]"}}
